# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` for local development with `wrangler dev`.
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored — never commit real secrets.

# Discord bot token (Developer Portal > your app > Bot > Reset Token).
# In production this is set with: wrangler secret put DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN
DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN="your-discord-bot-token"

# Local-only: skip Cloudflare Access JWT verification so you can test tools with
# `wrangler dev` (there is no Access proxy in front of a local dev server).
# NEVER set this to "true" in production.
DEV_AUTH_BYPASS="true"
